{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Sunrise is an expansion that introduces new skills designed to suppress abilities and dominate the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 skills inspired by Japanese motifs of harmony, along with brand-new costumes, this pack adds even more depth and style to your card battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills.<br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assassin [Discard]</strong>: Forces the selected player to discard their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bushido [Standard]</strong>: When this card moves to the attack zone, the attack zone is locked for 1 turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Nullification</strong>\u00a0<strong>[GameChanger]</strong>: Prevents all skill effects from activating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditation [Discard]</strong>: Return your hand to the deck and redraw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind\u2019s Eye [Standard]</strong>: Nullifies the advantage/disadvantage effects of the opposing card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suppression [Standard]</strong>: Removes a card from the GameChanger zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/extras/d2a822de857d5f60e75bc8751ad291f5.avif?t=1757004307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Costumes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total costume parts included: <strong>21</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/extras/5e248b29608cc2bf0601e13a47e05178.avif?t=1757004307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018671?t=1757004307","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018671?t=1757004307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/c51ef5f131e6e9e62c20d360562973ab0431d192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757004307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/c51ef5f131e6e9e62c20d360562973ab0431d192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757004307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Sunrise is an expansion that introduces new skills designed to suppress abilities and dominate the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 skills inspired by Japanese motifs of harmony, along with brand-new costumes, this pack adds even more depth and style to your card battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills.<br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assassin [Discard]</strong>: Forces the selected player to discard their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bushido [Standard]</strong>: When this card moves to the attack zone, the attack zone is locked for 1 turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Nullification</strong>\u00a0<strong>[GameChanger]</strong>: Prevents all skill effects from activating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditation [Discard]</strong>: Return your hand to the deck and redraw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind\u2019s Eye [Standard]</strong>: Nullifies the advantage/disadvantage effects of the opposing card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suppression [Standard]</strong>: Removes a card from the GameChanger zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/extras/d2a822de857d5f60e75bc8751ad291f5.avif?t=1757004307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Costumes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total costume parts included: <strong>21</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/extras/5e248b29608cc2bf0601e13a47e05178.avif?t=1757004307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["GasaiGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2010530","name":"MONSTER CARDS"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018671/78c3f5877fa7412ae279a4df8069170183706085/header.jpg?t=1757004307","is_free":false,"linux_requireme